Package: biomass_yieldTablesWS3
Title: LandR Yield Tables for WS3 Integration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Allen", "Larocque", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generate and cache WS3-compatible m3/ha yield curves per LandR
    development type, using inline LANDIS-II biomass growth equations and
    Boudewyn biomass-to-volume conversion.
